<title>PHILIPPINES: Basketball-Philippine pro league results.</title>
<headline>Basketball-Philippine pro league results.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of elimination round games on Friday in the Philippine Basketball Association third conference which includes American imports:</p>
<p>Formula Shell beat Sta Lucia Realty 109-98 (49-41)</p>
<p>Ginebra San Miguel beat Sunkist Orange 108-103 (51-53)</p>
